      avatar: 'ME',
      timestamp: 'Friday 09:55',
      content: 'cant send photo in teams as no access\n\nhave connected mqtt broadcast , mssql and sqlite (ddont have db instance for now )using function block which which stores plc json to db and another fn block which processes data to specific and stores in other db',
